              "content": "=Write a LinkedIn post that summarizes the key insights from the following blog post content. The purpose of the post is to increase engagement and drive traffic to the full blog via a compelling Call-To-Action (CTA).\n\nThe post must:\n\nBe SEO-optimized for LinkedIn visibility\n\nInclude relevant and trending hashtags to increase reach at the end of the post\n\nEnd with a clear CTA encouraging readers to click the blog link\n\nReference the original blog URL in the content naturally\n\nAdd bullets or emojies for better eye engagement if needed\n\nBlog URL: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.url }}\n~~~~~~~~~~ BLOG CONTENT START ~~~~~~~~~\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.content }}  \n~~~~~~~~~~ BLOG CONTENT END ~~~~~~~~~",
